            </note>
            <note corresp="#d469-f4" n="4" xml:id="d469-f4-content">
                <p>In reply by telegram 1482, Kosmos 54, from Moscow on April 20, 3 p. m., Secretary
                    Marshall expressed both his own and Ambassador Smith’s concurrence.</p>
            </note>
